      "writtenOn": "2025-06-10T11:06:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you describe why this is needed? We used to have such a method but did a lot of work to remove it as it didn\u0027t match the JS API.\n\nAn alternative is https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/SharedResourceMemory.h;drc\u003d5e74ac5d42bce00b534d992272e7fa09b53b300f;l\u003d99 though we also would like to remove it eventually.",
      "revId": "0122c5c3aa0a044dd07dfba50fdd5c49c9bd7de9",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
