        "id": 3466141
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-11T02:10:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To implement [[lastPresentImage]] behavior, my plan is in [HandleDissociateMailboxForPresent](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:gpu/command_buffer/service/webgpu_decoder_impl.cc;l\u003d2349;drc\u003d5e74ac5d42bce00b534d992272e7fa09b53b300f) check whether device is lost/destroyed, if device is lost, `ClearSharedImageWithSkia`. \n\nI don\u0027t find a better way to get device\u0027s state expect add an interface in DawnNative.",
      "parentUuid": "cee5979a_8912457f",
      "revId": "0122c5c3aa0a044dd07dfba50fdd5c49c9bd7de9",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b67ab718_f8987e26",
        "filename": "include/dawn/native/DawnNative.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
